        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>First Impressions LGN08-IPE, Ipe Door Pull Set</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Contemporary Wooden Door Handle with Stainless Steel End Caps is 36 inch long. It is comprised of a 1-1/2 inch diameter wood grip. This Laguna Series 8 Wood Door Handle can be surface mounted, thru-bolt mounted, or back-to-back mounted. The brackets and sleeves are  satin stainless steel. The wood is beautiful, right Ipe.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the First Impressions Laguna Door Handle in Ipe:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Material: Solid Ipe</li>\r\n<li>Pull Bracket Material: Solid Stainless Steel</li>\r\n<li>Pull End Cap Material: Solid Stainless Steel</li>\r\n<li>Total Length: 36\"</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center Mount: 27\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Diameter: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Sleeve Length: 3\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Projection: 3\"</li>\r\n<li>Clearance: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>",
